#33001
Saliu's Credits Room~
This room appears to have been made by some sort of divine force.  Magnificent
hieroglyphes on the walls appear to explain a tale of a long lost land...the lazy river.
The hieroglyphes tell you about the two-level river system filled with fish,
bugs, alligators, and many other tropical creatures.  They explain the places like
the alligator den and the river barracuda hole hidden within the weeds.  Drop in,
stay a while, and enjoy my new area!
~
330 1 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#33002
A Cascading Waterfall~
You stand underneath a beautiful waterfall.  Whatever rapids and sharp rocks
lie above the waterfall are not of your concern.  You feel relaxed and your
spirit is freed from the troubles of the world.    
~
