#33051
the Chamber of the Ages~
You have stumbled into what appears to be the home of some
ancient entity that has since left this place.

A message is carved into the stone walls here and reads:

"This is my legacy.  All of my work and my efforts in this 
world are now irrelevant.  The only thing that matters is
that I am remembered for who I am.  All the demons I have
slain and all the adventurers I have helped along the way
are but mere memories.  In my soul, I have achieved the
inner strength that I yearned for and for my spirit, I have
won peace eternal.  This my friend, is my legacy.

Salkris Lum IIXII"

You marvel at what is written on the walls here and cannot
even begin to fathom the true meaning of this message.
Throughout this room you can feel a brilliant radiance that
could only be the protection that Salkris brings to those
that respect his legacy.  A guardian from days long past..
~
